#: ../../09-testing.md:39 e95811991ee5464989114312347b58be
msgid "09. Testing Strategy"
msgstr "09. 测试策略"

#: ../../09-testing.md:43 58028f744ea04597a2ad47a682a37d6c
msgid ""
"The primary product of this repo is documentation, so \"testing\" is about "
"proving the docs (and any Lua they contain) are correct and stay fresh. The "
"rules below are verified against the Makefile and scripts in this tree."
msgstr ""
"本仓库的主要产物是文档，因此“测试”的目的是证明文档（及其中的任何 Lua）正确且保持新鲜。以下规则已对照本源码树中的 Makefile 和脚本核实。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:47 2fe497f66b0e4326a664c38013df3215
