msgid "`luacheck -q lua` and `lj-releng lua/*.lua`"
msgstr "`luacheck -q lua` 和 `lj-releng lua/*.lua`"

#: ../../09-testing.md 3049e6808f2c44739efba0ca3b79c174
msgid "Globals, line length, basic style"
msgstr "全局变量、行长、基本风格"

#: ../../09-testing.md 7465f1a57875424d8002c8b576773377
msgid "Runtime behavior (Lua/ngx_lua)"
msgstr "运行时行为（Lua/ngx_lua）"

#: ../../09-testing.md 8ab61cc411334bca85be7042730d7545
msgid "`prove -r t/` with **Test::Nginx** (`.t` files)"
msgstr "使用 **Test::Nginx** 运行 `prove -r t/`（`.t` 文件）"

#: ../../09-testing.md 5c394cfad9954ffd81be13264e1477c7
msgid ""
"Drives a real nginx from `PATH`, rooted at `t/servroot/` (default port 1984)"
msgstr "从 `PATH` 启动一个真实的 nginx，以 `t/servroot/` 为根（默认端口 1984）"

#: ../../09-testing.md ddc4c43abf0c4b99904ec6a566c474a8
msgid "Slow-network robustness"
msgstr "慢网络健壮性"

#: ../../09-testing.md f28a0a64380342bdaa0a0eccd8c38eff
msgid "**mockeagain** `MOCKEAGAIN=w`/`r` via `LD_PRELOAD`"
msgstr "通过 `LD_PRELOAD` 使用 **mockeagain** `MOCKEAGAIN=w`/`r`"

#: ../../09-testing.md d7b2941d73eb42b88e1bc43232684c11
msgid ""
"Exposes output-filter, parser, and cosocket bugs by mocking one-byte "
"reads/writes"
msgstr "通过模拟每次只读/写一个字节来暴露输出过滤器、解析器和 cosocket 的缺陷"

#: ../../09-testing.md:60 39a7736060754f288da993b358174db6
msgid "Runtime Function Testing (OpenResty Lua)"
msgstr "运行时功能测试（OpenResty Lua）"

#: ../../09-testing.md:62 c34d9ef87eb34586b5b85a677c64366b
msgid ""
"The official way to test `ngx_lua` handlers, cosockets, and phase behavior "
"is the [**Test::Nginx**](https://github.com/openresty/test-nginx) scaffold "
"(data-driven `.t` files built on `Test::Base`). It is the same harness "
"upstream `lua-nginx-module` tests are written in."
msgstr ""
"测试 `ngx_lua` 处理器、cosocket 和阶段行为的官方方式是使用 "
"[**Test::Nginx**](https://github.com/openresty/test-nginx) 脚手架（基于 "
"`Test::Base` 的数据驱动 `.t` 文件）。上游 `lua-nginx-module` 的测试就是用它写的。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:67 b2ac42260a504c8a812ebf038444f834
msgid ""
"Write a `.t` file under `t/` with `--- config` (nginx.conf block) and `--- "
"request` / `--- response_body` sections."
msgstr ""
"在 `t/` 下编写 `.t` 文件，内含 `--- config`（nginx.conf 块）以及 `--- request` / `--- "
"response_body` 小节。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:69 3105ca1aedf040a09886525a3cb52e7e
msgid ""
"Run it with `prove -r t/` (or `prove -v t/foo.t`). `Test::Nginx::Socket` "
"starts an nginx instance rooted at `t/servroot/`, listening by default on "
"port `1984` (override with the `TEST_NGINX_PORT` environment variable)."
msgstr ""
"用 `prove -r t/`（或 `prove -v t/foo.t`）运行它。`Test::Nginx::Socket` 会启动一个以 "
"`t/servroot/` 为根的 nginx 实例，默认监听 `1984` 端口（可用 `TEST_NGINX_PORT` 环境变量覆盖）。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:72 b43feb3dbd6c41378fbffafe8c46c4eb
msgid ""
"Use the `Test::Nginx::Socket::Lua` subclass for Lua-phase tests; the Stream "
"and Dgram subclasses cover stream/TCP-UDP cases."
msgstr ""
"Lua 阶段测试使用 `Test::Nginx::Socket::Lua` 子类；Stream 和 Dgram 子类覆盖 stream/TCP-UDP "
"场景。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:75 24e794af54e248eea1544d6a9357f32d
msgid ""
"For slow and hostile networks, preload "
"[**mockeagain**](https://github.com/openresty/mockeagain), an `LD_PRELOAD` "
"library that mocks the glibc `poll`/`read`/`writev`/`send`/ `recv` syscalls "
"so only one byte is read or written at a time (returning `EAGAIN`), exposing"
" the same \"connection hang\" bugs that only showed up on slow links:"
msgstr ""
"对于缓慢或恶劣的网络，可预加载 [**mockeagain**](https://github.com/openresty/mockeagain) ——"
" 一个 `LD_PRELOAD` 库，它模拟 glibc 的 `poll`/`read`/`writev`/`send`/`recv` "
"系统调用，使每次只读或写一个字节（返回 `EAGAIN`），从而暴露只在慢链路上出现的“连接挂起”类问题："

#: ../../09-testing.md:86 835121d41f3749c3bba3d622ea67c436
msgid ""
"`MOCKEAGAIN=w` mocks writes, `MOCKEAGAIN=r` mocks reads, `MOCKEAGAIN=wr` "
"both."
msgstr "`MOCKEAGAIN=w` 模拟写、`MOCKEAGAIN=r` 模拟读、`MOCKEAGAIN=wr` 两者都模拟。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:87 4be2e1ea7ca04209859597542c4938a7
msgid "`MOCKEAGAIN_VERBOSE=1` adds diagnostic lines to `error.log`."
msgstr "`MOCKEAGAIN_VERBOSE=1` 会向 `error.log` 输出诊断信息。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:88 6ab15d3dab7d41bfb6d0dbac2c50f830
msgid ""
"`MOCKEAGAIN_WRITE_TIMEOUT_PATTERN=\"...\"` triggers an indefinite write "
"timeout when the pattern appears in the output stream."
msgstr "当输出流中出现指定模式时，`MOCKEAGAIN_WRITE_TIMEOUT_PATTERN=\"...\"` 会触发一个无限期的写超时。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:90 adcfaf69c7be477992eef26a0a5fea9d
msgid ""
"When running under **Test::Nginx**, the required `env` directives (`env "
"LD_PRELOAD;`, `env MOCKEAGAIN;`, ...) are configured automatically."
msgstr ""
"在 **Test::Nginx** 下运行时，所需的 `env` 指令（`env LD_PRELOAD;`、`env MOCKEAGAIN;` "
"等）会自动配置。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:93 c2913b5703624896992f848b13abc7d7
msgid ""
"This is exactly the class of regression this PKB cares about for its [Data "
"and API](05-data-and-api.md) DNS contract and cosocket behavior: a wrong "
"`err` on a timed-out or half-written I/O only appears under such conditions."
msgstr ""
"这正是本知识库在[数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md) 的 DNS 契约和 cosocket "
"行为中所关心的回归类型：超时或只写了一半的 I/O 上的错误 `err`，只会在这种条件下出现。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:97 2e92260a40984cacb1a323b7aca25cb7
msgid "Core Regression Areas"
msgstr "核心回归领域"

#: ../../09-testing.md:99 b7f30d1768a940eba8841a78c6f793c1
msgid ""
"**DNS failure contract**: the Lua `err` strings and HTTP status mapping in "
"[Data and API](05-data-and-api.md) and [Workflows](06-workflows.md) must "
"stay exact against nginx 1.31.1 / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5. Any wording change in "
"the source is a regression to re-verify."
msgstr ""
"**DNS 失败契约**：[数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md)和[工作流](06-workflows.md)中的 Lua "
"`err` 字符串与 HTTP 状态码映射必须与 nginx 1.31.1 / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5 "
"保持一致。源码中任何措辞变化都构成需要重新验证的回归。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:103 c0422664c038476588cf912fe64023b9
msgid ""
"**Directive reference fidelity**: [08-lua-nginx-module](08-lua-nginx-"
"module.md) is a verbatim ingest of the README at commit `9661d95b`; re-"
"verify when the upstream README advances (record the new commit in "
"`source`)."
msgstr ""
"**指令参考保真度**：[08-lua-nginx-module](08-lua-nginx-module.md) 是在 commit "
"`9661d95b` 上对 README 的逐字摄取；上游 README 前进时需重新验证（并在 `source` 中记录新提交）。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:106 cb46261fad4544169e411f10bbf7bcf0
msgid ""
"**Bilingual parity**: every English page has a synced `zh_CN` catalog; a "
"page added to `index.md` must also be registered in `scripts/gen_index.py` "
"and get its `.po` catalog generated."
msgstr ""
"**双语对等**：每个英文页面都有同步的 `zh_CN` 目录；添加到 `index.md` 的页面也必须登记到 "
"`scripts/gen_index.py` 并生成对应的 `.po` 目录。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:110 b074c95e402a4d5199998a9ae3270085
msgid "Test Data and Environments"
msgstr "测试数据与环境"

#: ../../09-testing.md:112 5c3a13a879df471e81932fa54edf26dc
msgid ""
"**Fixtures or seeds**: the ingested README snapshot in [08-lua-nginx-"
"module](08-lua-nginx-module.md) and the pinned source URLs in each page's "
"`source`."
msgstr ""
"**夹具或种子数据**：[08-lua-nginx-module](08-lua-nginx-module.md) 中摄取的 README "
"快照，以及每页 `source` 中固定的源 URL。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:115 43d5d2e24d1e4d98966a654d10b9bb16
msgid ""
"**State isolation**: Sphinx `_build/` and `_generated/` are gitignored; each"
" build is reproducible from sources + `uv.lock`."
msgstr ""
"**状态隔离**：Sphinx 的 `_build/` 和 `_generated/` 已被 gitignore；每次构建都可从源码 + "
"`uv.lock` 复现。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:117 480f61567e694bcb9084a6e324d0ab9c
msgid ""
"**External dependency strategy**: none at build time (offline-capable); the "
"docs site itself is served as static HTML."
msgstr "**外部依赖策略**：构建期无外部依赖（支持离线）；文档站点本身以静态 HTML 提供服务。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:120 4117d827402445f79385936f118bfb3b
msgid "Validation Commands"
msgstr "验证命令"

#: ../../09-testing.md:129 33e6364860704e3bb08cf8a0daaef726
msgid "Per-page after an edit:"
msgstr "每次编辑后的逐页校验："

#: ../../09-testing.md:135 bd62bf8503424f1893f7585b8ec55ede
msgid "Manual Smoke Checks"
msgstr "手动冒烟检查"

#: ../../09-testing.md:137 52f2fc13b90a463ea2f0f509848c3edc
msgid ""
"`make serve` and open http://127.0.0.1:8000/ - landing page redirects by "
"browser language to `/en/` or `/zh/`."
msgstr ""
"`make serve` 并打开 http://127.0.0.1:8000/ —— 落地页按浏览器语言重定向到 `/en/` 或 `/zh/`。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:139 1966112c3ac44bf7844476062bd9b261
msgid ""
"Spot-check the [lua-nginx-module page](08-lua-nginx-module.md) for rendered "
"directives and anchored links."
msgstr "抽查 [lua-nginx-module 页面](08-lua-nginx-module.md)的指令渲染和锚点链接。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:141 5eed7565d4a54068836bf447aaca765d
msgid ""
"From [Quick Start](01-quick-start.md): `resty -e 'print(\"hello, world\")'` "
"and the `curl` hello-world server check the OpenResty runtime the docs "
"describe."
msgstr ""
"按[快速上手](01-quick-start.md)：用 `resty -e 'print(\"hello, world\")'` 和 `curl` "
"hello-world 服务器验证文档所描述的 OpenResty 运行时。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:144 16e1013198614e55923f04034af82471
msgid "Documentation Verification"
msgstr "文档验证"

#: ../../09-testing.md:146 7ed3c92f7068416cb771e03404c2ad51
msgid ""
"Because this PKB is published docs, the build gate above is the main "
"verification. Additionally, before a release: run `make pkb-review-status` "
"to audit confidentiality/review state and `make pkb-check-i18n` to confirm "
"translations are in sync."
msgstr ""
"因为本知识库是发布的文档，上面的构建关卡是主要验证。此外，发布前：运行 `make pkb-review-status` 审计保密等级/评审状态，并运行"
" `make pkb-check-i18n` 确认翻译同步。"

#: ../../09-testing.md:151 c7426426d96549d8b4b31e6c877e6dea
msgid "Regression Additions"
msgstr "回归补充"

#: ../../09-testing.md:153 fd446444d00b4fe0b4b47abbe7d3a31c
msgid ""
"When a claim in the PKB is corrected (for example a DNS error string that "
"did not match the code), record here:"
msgstr "当知识库中的论断被纠正时（例如某个与代码不符的 DNS 错误字符串），在此记录："

#: ../../09-testing.md:156 bf2794cb25884c8ca5677e55abc0d78d
msgid "the original (wrong) claim and the corrected one"
msgstr "原始的（错误）论断和更正后的论断"

#: ../../09-testing.md:157 4b1de668f7234489bbe5f2f38ebbbb43
msgid "the source (file or commit) that proves the fix"
msgstr "证明修复的源（文件或提交）"

#: ../../09-testing.md:158 25138fa85f2c4bf59e61760a04dd5ede
msgid ""
"the smallest check that catches it next time (usually a grep against the "
"expected `err` substring in [Data and API](05-data-and-api.md))"
msgstr "下次能捕获它的最小检查（通常是在[数据与 API](05-data-and-api.md)中按预期的 `err` 子串做 grep）"

#: ../../09-testing.md:161 ff7b96a38f2643acb45aee4cf216bce6
msgid "Related Documentation"
msgstr "相关文档"

